# The local counterpart of the device's own /data/media: whatever has been
# uploaded there, which is never this repo's business. The folder itself
# stays, so the layout survives a fresh clone (see the Makefile, which only
# ever creates it on the device).
data/media/*
!data/media/.gitkeep
